      "text": "Design Ad Click Aggregator",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design Ad Click Aggregator",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BUj585bvSCxDRkNJsRsS6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -166.8610041001667,
      "y": -3022.2032641611163,
      "width": 519.19970703125,
      "height": 760,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "yxBiaLT4DD4aXhSkzIVbM"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1240362628,
      "version": 1126,
      "versionNonce": 1765809596,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786122718417,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements:\nFunctional: \n- click and ad and redirect to advertisement website\n- advertisement can see every click entries over time, \nwith respect to 1 minute granularity \n\n---out of scope---\n- ads targeting and serving mechanism\n- cross device tracking\n- integration with channels (slack, mail)\n\nnon functional \n- scale up to 10M ads, and 10K click /sec\n- low latenccy\n- data integrity\n- as relatime as possilbe (1 min granularity)\n- idempotemcy\n\n--- out of scope ---\n- spam detection\n- demogreaphic profilig\n- coversin treacking (how many click converts in to buying)\n\ninput:\n- claick data \n- ads query\n\noutput\n- redirection\n- aggregated data (click metrics)\n\nData flow:\n1. user click an ad\n2. user redirection\n3. data validation\n4. click data logged\n5. click data aggregated\n6. aggregated data queried",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements:\nFunctional: \n- click and ad and redirect to advertisement website\n- advertisement can see every click entries over time, \nwith respect to 1 minute granularity \n\n---out of scope---\n- ads targeting and serving mechanism\n- cross device tracking\n- integration with channels (slack, mail)\n\nnon functional \n- scale up to 10M ads, and 10K click /sec\n- low latenccy\n- data integrity\n- as relatime as possilbe (1 min granularity)\n- idempotemcy\n\n--- out of scope ---\n- spam detection\n- demogreaphic profilig\n- coversin treacking (how many click converts in to buying)\n\ninput:\n- claick data \n- ads query\n\noutput\n- redirection\n- aggregated data (click metrics)\n\nData flow:\n1. user click an ad\n2. user redirection\n3. data validation\n4. click data logged\n5. click data aggregated\n6. aggregated data queried",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
